    Rescales them so that the elements of the n-dimensional output Tensor
    lie in the range `[0, 1]` and sum to 1.

    Softmin is defined as:

    .. math::
        \text{Softmin}(x_{i}) = \frac{\exp(-x_i)}{\sum_j \exp(-x_j)}

